  "description": "To Eunsu, Taekyung was her first love and her first man.\n\n\"I'm not such a good guy.\"\n\nA woman who tried to heal every wound with love.\n\nA man who used even her sincere feelings as a means to achieve his own success.\n\nTheir marriage began with ulterior motives. But when it comes to an end, will any genuine love remain?\n\n**Original Novel:**    \nChapters: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/2152001492)   \nVolumes: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/2152001590), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/E000162775), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=13918088) \n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1716003372)",
